<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on June 6.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on June 6.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				  June 6		 June 5</p>
<p>Fed acct			 5.590		  5.197</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	   4.694		  5.567</p>
<p>Cash balance		  10.284		 10.773</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	5,266.071	     5,269.147</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $6 million were issued and $93 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
</text>
